/**
 * Retrieves all the outcomes for gameDays in a given year, or all years if
 * `year` is zero.
 * @param year - The year to include, or zero for all year.
 * @param untilGameDay - The gameDay ID to stop at (inclusive), or undefined
 * to include all.
